{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>Elohim has given my reward, that I gave my maidservant to my husband.</b> Even though my sister did the same, she did so because she had no sons. But I had many sons, and on account of the kindness I performed in giving my maidservant to him — <b>Elohim has given my reward.</b> And because she said thus, and because she said ״כי שכר שכרתיך״ (for I have hired you), he is called Issachar with two sins."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:06:43.472200415Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}